[02:45.72]provisional [prəˈvɪʒənl]a. 临时的；暂定的
[02:49.56]approach [əˈprəʊtʃ]v. 向…靠近；接近；着手处理；探讨 n. 靠近；接近；途径，方式；态度 例 You'll approach the task more confidently knowing that you're ready. 搭 approach sb. about sth. 接洽，交涉 / at the approach of 接近
[03:08.16]inquiry [ɪnˈkwaiəri]n. 调查；询问；询价，询盘 例 I made a confldential inquiry into the recent business event.
