[08:34.92]perspective [pəˈspektɪv]n. (观察问题的)视角，观点 例 You can see yourself from a new perspective. 搭 from the perspective of 从…角度看
[08:47.04]decipher [dɪˈsaɪfə(r)]v. 破解(密码等)；将密码译成正常语 言 例 She reluctantly got out the paper and pen in preparation for deciphering the words in the code. 搭 decipher sign 辨识标记
