[11:20.04]reliance [rɪˈlaɪəns]n. 信任，信赖；受信赖的人或物 搭 put reliance on sb.'s promises 信赖某人的诺 言
[11:28.20]avid [ˈævɪd]a. 渴望的；贪婪的；热心的 例 The international market has become increasingly avid about classical music in recent years. 搭 avid for 渴望得到 / take an avid interest in 对…极其感兴趣
